{"skill":{"slug":"hot-news-aggregator","displayName":"hot-news-aggregator"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1773123743098,"changelog":"- Initial release of Hot News Aggregator.\n- Aggregates and automatically summarizes domestic and international news in society, technology, and military.\n- Supports automatic searching, filtering, and structured summarization of key news points from multiple trusted sources.\n- Includes credibility guidelines prioritizing official and authoritative sources.\n- Provides clear output formatting for easy news review.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":1658,"sha256":"cf944544d7689c47d1d50b75a2623f21ffbe59115583ef675f66880aa3ed1d5d","contentType":null},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2217,"sha256":"db8d5f4a881b737db2b24bb8887ca71132f73aab94aa473b8d8dea69de4ce8b8","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789137338918,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"6d8fd3ff50235f4060900672251282c269fb50f8268fa8931683c94c1496c4bb","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/6d8fd3ff50235f4060900672251282c269fb50f8268fa8931683c94c1496c4bb","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1780085848518},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":16,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":2,"checkedAt":1789137338918},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill only guides the agent to search public news sources and summarize them, with no code execution, persistence, or sensitive data access.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Public web access is proportionate for current news aggregation, and the skill does not request local files, credentials, private data, or mutation authority.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The inspected package contains a single markdown skill file and no install scripts, dependencies, executable code, or external payload loading.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The trigger is broad for social, technology, and military news, and the instructions are primarily in Chinese, but this affects invocation and language fit rather than creating a security concern.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"No persistence, background workers, memory writes, privilege escalation, tool hijacking, or system modification instructions were found.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is news aggregation, and the artifact's capabilities are limited to using web search/fetch tools against listed public news sites, filtering sources, and producing a structured summary.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Before installing, be aware that the skill may activate for broad news-summary requests and tends to format output in Chinese. It is otherwise limited to summarizing public news sources and does not appear to access private data or modify your environment.","findings":"[SQP-1] expected: The broad invocation language is real, but it is aligned with a low-impact public-news summarization skill and does not add sensitive authority.\n[SQP-3] expected: The Chinese-first wording matches the artifact's apparent audience; it should ideally follow the user's language preference, but it is not hidden or unsafe behavior.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789137338918}}}}}